text.section:
The provisions of subsection A shall not apply to:

Local, state or federal public lands on which fences are erected to protect public health or safety;


Enclosures permitted by the Department as fallow deer farms or permitted exhibitors holding native deer for educational purposes;


Enclosures permitted by the U.S. Department of Agriculture as exhibitors, breeders, or dealers; or


Zoos accredited by the American Zoological Association.
